Package: bilinear
Type: Package
Title: Subset Bilinear Time Series Models
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Zaki Abiyu", "Aqilah", email = "zakiabiqu@gmail.com", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Estimation, residual diagnostics and forecasting for subset
    bilinear time series models with autoregressive, moving-average and
    bilinear terms, following Subba Rao and Gabr (1984)
    <doi:10.1007/978-1-4684-6318-7>. Parameters are estimated by conditional
    least squares using exact recursive derivatives and Gauss-Newton
    iterations with step-halving; multi-step forecasts are computed by
    Monte Carlo simulation of the conditional expectation.
